OL,6,     Gdays of Atlantic Records,
OL,7,     Gexploring how the company was set
OL,8,     Gup and how it became home to some
OL,9,     Gof the world's greatest soul
OL,10,     Gsingers.
OL,11,G0200FThe Atlantic Records Story
